  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reconstruction of social infrastructure in Mykolaiv through a strong civil society - DanChurchAid</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to rebuild critical social infrastructure in Mykolaiv, while the role and capacity of civil society in Ukraine is strengthened as active actors, which strengthen the capacity of promoting democratic and transparent processes and values in the early recovery of Ukraine. This will result in war-affected communities of Mykolaiv regaining access to critical social infrastructure, which will enable safe and accessible learning environments and the return of displaced people. Moreover, the project will contribute to enabling the local civil society as active and capable actors, who engage in and participate in the democratic and transparent recovery process of Mykolaiv Oblast.</narrative>
  </description>
